  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> denote greatest integer less than or equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>. If for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msup></math>,&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></munderover><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>j</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> is equal to :",
